/1052950936261496832235176.png/E7xs9VmXdlQwhUv9wo7eERbV3WdKtD5iJiSieSYkonk\"/><figcaption>古代沒有避孕套，青樓女子如何避孕？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"古代沒有避孕套，青樓女子如何避孕？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251009/1052950791779782656192367.png/PNKTN-7op3WMh2PNgPzIwZG54DV0DRM38zW2UPM1tlA\"/><figcaption>古代沒有避孕套，青樓女子如何避孕？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"古代沒有避孕套，青樓女子如何避孕？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251009/1052950794363604992602147.png/BvD-eOtPUqWf0MUuCU2qGDLNMi-s-1VAe1xnVntcZ1Y\"/><figcaption>古代沒有避孕套，青樓女子如何避孕？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文經《風傳媒》授權轉載，原文：清朝嬪妃為何要戴護甲套？「3強大用途」揭曉！不只是美觀，還能方便皇帝臨幸】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T01:40:39.114267+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1412,"images":34,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T01:30:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T02:38:14.775355+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T01:38:25.742882+00:00","content_hash":"e18eb3fc140aae42dad738b6846465500c179ee302a57d9f3ac956ec4fac7810","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}